Subject: [PATCH 6/6] docs(post): record the same-angle arc rule (#3474)

The module doc of arc_guard.rs names the rule, and
docs/decisions/3474-same-angle-arc.md records what was chosen, why,
and what was dropped.

Fixes #3474

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/post/src/post/arc_guard.rs     |  6 ++-
 docs/decisions/3474-same-angle-arc.md | 61 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
